OL,3,CArsenal win Premier League for first
OL,4,Ctime in 22 years
OL,6,FArsenal have won the Premier League
OL,7,Ffor the first time in 22 years.
OL,9,FManchester City were held to a 1-1
OL,10,Fdraw by Bournemouth on Tuesday night,
OL,11,Fleaving Arsenal to take the title
OL,12,Fafter more than two decades of waiting.
OL,14,FThe Gunners' long wait to add to their
OL,15,F13 top-flight titles was ended when
OL,16,FPep Guardiola's side dropped points in
OL,17,Ftheir penultimate match, the game in
OL,18,Fhand they had over their rivals.
