CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F377A1783964929
OL,3,CArsenal win Premier League for first
OL,4,Ctime in 22 years
OL,6,FIt left Arsenal with an unassailable
OL,7,Flead at the top and kicked off the
OL,8,Fcelebrations in north London.
OL,10,FMikel Arteta's side will formally be
OL,11,Fpresented with the trophy on Sunday
OL,12,Fafter their final match of the season
OL,13,Fat Crystal Palace.
OL,15,FThey could still make it an historic
OL,16,Fdouble for the club as they chase
OL,17,Ftheir first Champions League title in
OL,18,Fthe final against Paris St Germain
OL,19,Flater this month.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
