OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F377A1783964929
OL,3,CArsenal win Premier League for first
OL,4,Ctime in 22 years
OL,6,FThe league title ended a six-year
OL,7,Fperiod without a trophy and is
OL,8,FArteta's second major honour in charge
OL,9,Fafter the 2020 FA Cup victory.
OL,11,FMidfielder Declan Rice posted a
OL,12,Fpicture on Instagram with his team-
OL,13,Fmates with the caption "I told you
OL,14,Fall.. it's done."
OL,16,FFormer Gunners boss Arsene Wenger, who
OL,17,Fled the team to their last title, in
OL,18,F2004, featured in a celebratory post
OL,19,Ffrom the Gunners on their X account.
OL,26,@uD@XOUvD@QO]
