OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F377A1783964929
OL,3,CArsenal win Premier League for first
OL,4,Ctime in 22 years
OL,6,FHe said: "You did it. Champions go on
OL,7,Fwhen others stop. This is your time.
OL,8,FNow, go on and enjoy every moment."
OL,10,FFormer England goalkeeper David
OL,11,FSeaman, who made more than 400
OL,12,Fappearances for Arsenal between 1990
OL,13,Fand 2003, said on X: "Premier League
OL,14,Fchampions!!! What a moment!!! What a
OL,15,Fseason!!!!!!!! EPIC!!!!!!!!!! Longest
OL,16,F(22 years and ) three minutes of MY
OL,17,FLIFE..."
