OL,3,CArsenal win Premier League for first
OL,4,Ctime in 22 years
OL,6,FManchester City manager Pep Guardiola,
OL,7,Fwho had Arteta as his assistant for
OL,8,Ftwo of City's Premier League titles,
OL,9,Fpaid tribute to his Gunners
OL,10,Fcounterpart.
OL,12,F"We were close. On behalf of everyone
OL,13,Fat Manchester City, we congratulate
OL,14,FMikel and all the staff, players and
OL,15,Ffans on winning the Premier League,"
OL,16,Fhe told Sky Sports. "They deserve it,
OL,17,Ffor so much hard work and effort."
